{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38135","headline":"归紫阁下 · 韩偓","name":"归紫阁下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一笈携归紫阁峰，马蹄闲慢水溶溶。\n黄昏後见山田火，胧{月悤}时闻县郭钟。\n瘦竹迸生僧坐石，野藤缠杀鹤翘松。\n钓矶自别经秋雨，长得莓苔更几重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}